---
import SectionHeader from '../ui/SectionHeader.astro';
---

<section class="recognition container">
  <SectionHeader
    kicker="The part nobody chose"
    title="You didn't sign up to run a business."
    copy="The math signed you up anyway."
  />
  <div class="beats">
    <article>
      <h3>The arithmetic</h3>
      <p>
        Associate positions pay $60–80K. School cost $200K or more. For a lot of DCs,
        opening a practice wasn't the dream — it was the only line that added up.
      </p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <h3>The second job</h3>
      <p>
        So now there's billing, scheduling, reminders, statements, follow-up. Nobody
        covered any of it in school, and none of it is why you're in this.
      </p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <h3>The actual work</h3>
      <p>
        Patients. The adjustment. Getting someone out of pain and back to their life.
        That part deserves more of your day than the paperwork gets.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .recognition {
    padding: 96px 0 20px;
    display: grid;
    gap: 44px;
  }

  .beats {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 32px;
  }

  article {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    padding-top: 20px;
    display: grid;
    gap: 10px;
    align-content: start;
  }

  h3 {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  p {
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .beats {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 22px;
    }
  }
</style>
